API call examples:
list models:
curl http://localhost:11434/api/tags


get model details

curl http://localhost:11434/api/show -d '{
  "model": "gemma3"
}'

load model:
curl http://localhost:11434/api/pull -d '{
  "model": "gemma3"
}'


delete model:
curl -X DELETE http://localhost:11434/api/delete -d '{
  "model": "gemma3"
}'
